      "title": "Rowa asked what the **pharmacy of the future** could look like.",
      "intro": [
        "I tried answering that question for Rowa and found some interesting visual answers.",
        "Together with a talented team of artists that I directed, we created a playful, tangible world full of visual metaphors and fun stories. Meet Maria and Danielius who‘ll take you on a smooth trip through various iterations of future pharmacies and solutions for modern customers.",
